{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123920/extras/clip_memory.gif?t=1744972512\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of <strong>Coral</strong>, one of the last survivors of a failed mission to colonize an unknown planet, and explore what remains of the mothership, the <strong>Crystal Mountain</strong>, now a derelict wreck shrouded in flickering lights, metallic echoes, and unsettling sounds. But you're not alone: alien creatures, oozing black masses with a single red eye, roam the ruins.</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123920/extras/store_combat_01.gif?t=1744972512\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No explicit missions, no arrows pointing the way. Your curiosity is your guide: explore freely and follow the hidden clues scattered throughout the world. You'll need to piece together traces and fragments of the past to uncover the truth. Nothing is as it seems, each discovery may reveal unexpected connections and unlock secrets waiting to be found.</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123920/extras/clip_firefly.gif?t=1744972512\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Non-linear exploration of vertically interconnected areas<br></li><li> Fast-paced, dynamic combat system<br></li><li> RPG elements with unlockable abilities and upgrades<br></li><li> Intense and memorable boss fights<br></li><li> Tons of secrets to discover</li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123920/extras/store_memory_03.gif?t=1744972512\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3123920?t=1744972512","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744972512","capsule_image":"https://shar